==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 12~18 seconds<sup>360f~540f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 18~24 seconds<sup>540f~720f</sup>.
*1 [[Divine Cyclone]] spawns as the boss after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>.
*1 [[White Cyclone]] spawns as the boss after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Cyclone]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Cyclone]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
As the first 3 [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]]s all have different types but share [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]], the player should avoid [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] and [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark Cats]] and rather go with [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating Cats]] that work on the first 3. Don't forget [[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|anti-Angel Cats]] against the last Cyclone as well. The general strategy to beat this stage is the same as usual when facing Cyclones: stalling with support Cats and long ranged Cats.

If you have [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Bishop Cat]]'s [[True Form]], Sanzo Cat, the first 3 Cyclones will be really easy, as Sanzo Cat's stackable, reliable Area Slow will reduce the Cyclones to extremely slow progression towards your base. Divine Cyclone will still need [[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|anti-Angel Cats]], as with other "floating" [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angels]]. With [[Talents]], Sanzo can slow Angels as well, and can entirely cripple all the Cyclones enough to let DPS cats like [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed UFO Cat]] quickly shred them.

[[Stilts Cat (Rare Cat)|Totem Cat]] actually finds purpose in this stage, as he outranges Divine Cyclone by more than 200 range and has a 30% chance to knock it back (50% in True Form). If you do not have many reliable anti-Angels, Totem Cat is likely the easiest to obtain as well as to use.

